{"id":"n70813-1-7","stage":1,"title":"모든 · 全","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70813-1-7-1","ko":"모든 사람들이 다 참석했는지 알아 봐.","zh":"查一下人是不是都到齐了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모든","meaning":"全，所有","explanation":"모든：全，所有","readings":[{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70813","senseId":"1","lemma":"모든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"참석했는지","meaning":"参加，出席","explanation":"참석하다：参加，出席；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"참석하다","audio":"/audio/f054f7e6fad02b9e2341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62321","senseId":"1","lemma":"참석하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참석했는지","audio":"/audio/6b2b36d62c305070bde8.mp3"}},{"text":"알아","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아","audio":"/audio/afb5239ccd10c522dc68.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f069e2cf4e340740","term":"모든","zh":"全，所有","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3","entryId":"70813","definition":"一个不漏或一个不剩，全部的。","pronunciation":["모ː든"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"f054f7e6fad02b9e","term":"참석하다","zh":"参加，出席","audio":"/audio/f054f7e6fad02b9e2341.mp3","entryId":"62321","definition":"去会议或聚会等场合共同参与。","pronunciation":["참서카다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4764814d4a61a580a80.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70813-1-7-2","ko":"오기로 한 예순두 명이 모두 참석했습니다.","zh":"说好要来的六十二人都到齐了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오기로","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오기로","audio":"/audio/2f0abcde5892ce8fd267.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"te